<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>Mixed L01B - Z2 + 6 Sprints</name>
    <description>Mixed - level 1 of 10, variant B. Z2 + 6 Sprints.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 10 min @ 68%, 6 x (10 s @ 160% / 4:50 @ 66%), 5 min @ 68%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Zone 2 with six 10-second all-out sprints and full recovery. The 160% target is a floor - beat it.

Estimated TSS: 45.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="Mixed"/>
        <tag name="Level 1"/>
    </tags>
    <workout>
        <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.45" PowerHigh="0.75">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Mixed session today. Warm up progressively."/>
        </Warmup>
        <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.68">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Recover: 10 min easy. Drink."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <IntervalsT Repeat="6" OnDuration="10" OffDuration="290" OnPower="1.60" OffPower="0.66">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="GO! 10 s at 160%. Commit from the first pedal stroke."/>
        </IntervalsT>
        <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.68">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Recover: 5 min easy. Drink."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <Cooldown Duration="300" PowerLow="0.60" PowerHigh="0.45">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Well done. Cool down easy."/>
        </Cooldown>
    </workout>
</workout_file>
